#3700
#0The Entrance to Mud School#n~
#0The room you now stand in is musty, and dust hangs in the air. Light streams
down into the room from a single window in the ceiling. This is the Genesis
School. Type north to continue into the school. A stone arch leads south, into
a heavily forested area.
~
