#3701
A hallway in the Genesis School~
You are now standing in a musty room. The walls are made of a heavy
grey stone. The room is lit by a window in the east wall.  A sign on the wall
beckons your attention, type look sign to read it. An archway leads south,
back to the entryroom, while the hallway continues west.
~
0 36 0
E
sign~
#0Welcome to the Genesis Mud School.

As you walk through the school, you will see signs like this. Type 'look sign'
to view it. This school will teach you basic commands which will help you to
interact with the world around you. The first of these commands are the
Movement commands. They are as follows:
North
South
East
West
Up
Down

These commands move you in a direction. Specifically, the one mentioned.
~
