#3709
#0The combat training room~
This room is made from blocks of red marble, and the floor is covered in sand.
Blood is splattered across the floor, and a pit in the center of the room has
a ladder leading down into it. It contains a monster. A metal sign is posted
on the wall, you had better read it.
~
0 12 0
E
sign~
Greetings, and welcom to combat training.

The first step is knowing what you can fight safely.  Use the command
Consider to figure out if you can kill a monster.  Avoid attacking monsters
that can injure you easily.

The second step is knowing when to run. A monster has been placed in the pit.
It is too powerful for you to kill, but it probably won't kill you.Enter
the pit, then consider him, then type kill to attack him.  After some
combat, type flee to escape from the monster. That will return you to this
room. After you try that, go west to continue your training.
~
D3
You see the next station of Mud School.
~
~
