#3712
#0The Monster Storeroom~
You are now standing in the Monster Storeroom.  Each of the cardinal exits
have monsters in them. A sign is clearly posted, and it is suggested that you
look at it. When you have finished killing the monsters, head down.
~
0 12 0
E
sign~
Greetings, and Welcome to the Monster Storeroom. In this section of Mud
School, the fine members of the School have gathered several monster for you
to kill. Kill them, and if you wish, you may take their equipment.

After you kill each monster, remember to get your newly won treasure out of
the monster's corpse. Use the command get all corpse to retreive it from the
corpse. After that you should sacrifice the corpse, so that other players will
not be able to track you.

Between battles, you WILL need to regenerate hp by sleeping or resting.
You may Rest to regenerate Hps, or you can Sleep. Sleep will regen you faster,
but you will not be able to use that many commands while you sleep.
~
