#3718
#0The Store in Mud School~
The store reeks of rotting meat and fruit. The stone walls and wooden shelves
are coated in a thick layer of dust. Light barely shows through a window,
coated with dust and cobwebs, set high in the wall. The counter has a large
"CLOSED" sign sitting on it, a spiderweb hooked to one end. A faded sign is
behind the counter. The doorways out leads north.
~
